  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Installing monitoring systems for identifying changes in the environment in Foz do Tapau&#xe1;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The START Fund Learning Grant project aims to strengthen existing informal systems by developing a more robust monitoring system capable of identifying environmental changes that may signal risks to communities, such as droughts or flooding. The project will support local communities in combining Indigenous and traditional knowledge with relevant data collection methods, enabling them to better anticipate and respond to climate-related crises.</narrative>
  </description>
